    <briefdescription>
<para>Controls which predefined government source groups are activated. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Each group maps to entries in the <ref refid="classthemis_1_1scraper_1_1_gov_source_catalog" kindref="compound">GovSourceCatalog</ref>. An empty list means no predefined sources are used (only whitelist seed_urls are crawled). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
